<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" WIDTH="100%" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt"><TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
<TD STYLE="width: 1in"></TD><TD STYLE="width: 0.5in">(ii)</TD><TD STYLE="text-align: justify">commissioning, completing, and filing all required and necessary studies, assessments, plans, reports,
and surveys, including, without limitation, cadastral and boundary surveys, subdivision plans, and any necessary planning assessments
required in connection with the Combination and the Subdivision; and</TD></TR></TABLE>

