<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify">With respect to the Property Y Complex
Land, on the Closing Date, the Parties shall execute and record an access easement (the &ldquo;<B><I>Property Y Reciprocal Easement Agreement&rdquo;</I></B>)
